# Whitelist: this repo holds only what is needed to build the app, plus its icon and README.
# Everything else (build output, screenshots, release builds, personal settings) is ignored.
# To add a new source file, list it below with a leading "!".
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!MK2PadEMU.csproj
!Program.cs
!MainWindow.xaml
!MainWindow.xaml.cs
!defaults.json
!app.ico
!screenshots/
!screenshots/*.png
